# KaspaCom Web Wallet - Cursor Rules

Angular 19 crypto wallet embedded as iframe, uses Kaspa WASM.

## When Editing src/main.ts

DO NOT remove:
- `loadingTimeout` (prevents infinite loading screen)
- `checkStorageAvailability()` check
- Any `Sentry.captureException()` calls
- `clearTimeout(loadingTimeout)` on success

## When Adding Sentry Error Tracking

Required: `error_type` tag must be one of:
- `storage_blocked`
- `wasm_load_failure`
- `bootstrap_failure`  
- `initialization_timeout`

## When Initializing Kaspa WASM

Use: `kaspa.default({ module_or_path: './kaspa/kaspa_bg.wasm' })`
NOT: `kaspa.default('./kaspa/kaspa_bg.wasm')` (deprecated API)

## When Modifying Domain Access

Allowed domains in `src/environments/*.ts`:
- Dev: localhost, 127.0.0.1, local.kaspa.com, dev-wallet.kaspa.com
- Prod: wallet.kaspa.com
- Stage: stage-wallet.kaspa.com

Require security review before changes.

